      "readme_excerpt": "# DeepSeek-chan\n\nDeepSeek-chan Codex pet animation development workspace.\n\n## Current state\n\n- Installed animation baseline: `v64`\n- Atlas format: Codex pet sprite version 2\n- Atlas size: `1536 x 2288`\n- Cell size: `192 x 208`\n- Standard actions: idle, running-right, running-left, waving, jumping, failed, waiting, running, and review\n- Includes 16 look directions, animation source material, deterministic assembly scripts, and QA previews\n\nThe current v64 repair aligns the idle-to-hover transition so the body, face, hair, skirt, feet, scale, and baseline remain fixed; only the eyelids and distal tail respond.\n\n## Repository contents\n\n- `release/deepseek-chan/` — current installable v64 package, previews, and final QA reports\n- `runs/deepseek-chan/scripts/` — current extraction, registration, assembly, and QA utilities\n- `runs/deepseek-chan/references/` — canonical character plus layout guides\n\nOlder atlas iterations, intermediate frames, generated dependency bundles, and historical QA output remain local and are intentionally excluded from version control.\n",
